# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Tarren Mill

step Tarren Mill
  tip Tarren Mill is your base for this guide: the hearth brings you back here twice. Everyone stands around the town square.
  getfp "Tarren Mill"
  accept 509                          -- Inside
  collect 7771 quest 1536 only Shaman -- Fill the Empty Red Waterskin at the Spring Well beside the inn
  accept 501
  accept 496                          -- Apothecary Lydon
  turnin 493                          -- Apothecary Lydon
  turnin 494 optional -- High Executor Darthalia
  accept 527                          -- High Executor Darthalia
  accept 549                          -- The WANTED poster by the inn
  accept 498                          -- Krusk, inside
  sethome "Tarren Mill" npc 2388      -- Innkeeper Shay: the last guide binds here, so this usually ticks at once
  accept 567                          -- The Dangerous! poster: Kalaba and Wilkes come up here, the clerk and the miner on the visit at about 32; inside

step Serge Hinott
  only Rogue
  tip After returning Mission: Possible But Not Probable to Shenthul, bring Hinott's Assistance to Serge Hinott in Tarren Mill. Stay beside him until the brewing objective completes, then hand in the follow-up to learn Poisons. Finish it even if the Zanzil poison has already been removed; removing the debuff alone does not teach the skill.
  turnin 2479 optional                -- Serge Hinott
  accept 2480 optional
  complete 2480 optional
  turnin 2480 optional                -- Serge Hinott: Poisons
  note "Poison chain unfinished? Resume your current stage in the Class guide Poisons (Horde); completed quests do not need restarting. Arrange a group for Gallywix, finish the Hinott follow-up, then return to this leveling guide."

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- West: the hills and Hillsbrad Fields

step Bears, creepers and lions
  tip West of Tarren Mill, Gray Bears, Forest Moss Creepers and Starving Mountain Lions roam the hills on the way down to the farms. The creepers drop Creeper Ichor rarely; you need only one.
  collect 3476 quest 496.1 @54.3,39.6
  collect 3477 quest 496.2

