# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To Tarren Mill

step To the Undercity
  only Skyborne
  zone Undercity
  tip Head east to the Crossroads and fly to Orgrimmar. Take the zeppelin from the towers outside Orgrimmar to Tirisfal Glades; the Undercity lies below the Ruins of Lordaeron. The bat handler is in the Trade Quarter.
  kill 10181 quest 93739.4 "Talk to Lady Sylvanas Windrunner" only Skyborne optional -- Speak with Lady Sylvanas Windrunner, in the Royal Quarter: Exploring the Horde

step Aelthalyste
  only Undead,Priest
  tip Aelthalyste stands in the War Quarter.
  turnin 5646 only Undead -- Aelthalyste: Dark Sacrifice

